---
// The three offers, from the one-sheet (Advisory has one extra sentence). Used on Home and Work with me.
---

<div class="offers">
  <div>
    <span class="when">About 1 day a week</span>
    <h3 class="offer-name">Advisory</h3>
    <p>Roadmap and priority reviews, plus coaching. It fits a founder who still makes the product calls, or a first-time product manager who wants a second opinion.</p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <span class="when">About 2 days a week</span>
    <h3 class="offer-name">Fractional product lead</h3>
    <p>I own the roadmap and run the product team day to day. It fits a company that has stalled or is still hiring a permanent product leader.</p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <span class="when">Fixed scope</span>
    <h3 class="offer-name">Due diligence &amp; readouts</h3>
    <p>Product due diligence before you buy or partner, with an integration plan. Or the week-one readout on its own, yours to keep.</p>
  </div>
</div>
